  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security through voucher and in-kind assistance for drought affected communities in Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">28000</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing COVID-19-Related Unemployment</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed follow-up project to the completed project AFG 03/19 aims to provide voucher assistance and in-kind support for the purchase of nutritious foods and non-food items and the rehabilitation of agricultural production and livestock farming. The emergency aid is intended to help additional affected communities to reduce the need for negative coping strategies and to mitigate the negative consequences of the drought, whilst mitigating the currently unfolding COVID-19 pandemic.</narrative>
  </description>
